  m_Name: 1200 orang laut
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  title: "Rickshaws and Bullock Carts \u2013 1800s "
  info: "The Orang Laut, or \"Sea People,\" were the island\u2019s earliest known
    inhabitants, living along the coasts and waterways. As skilled navigators and
    traders, they facilitated commerce between the Malay Archipelago and other regions.
    Their unique seafaring culture and intimate knowledge of local waters made them
    indispensable to regional trade networks and early settlers. "
  image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: cce8898b6e8aa4da6bb90f5e956f42e7, type: 3}
